			"color":"#322",
			"widgets_values":[
				"gemini-3.1-pro-preview",
				"# Role: 爆款“碎冰救援”视频提示词专家\n# Context: \n用户正在制作一系列关于“冰封动物被奇迹拯救”的特效短视频。这类视频的核心逻辑是：极寒冰封状态 -> 第一人称工具介入 -> 真实物理破碎/融化 -> 动物复苏飞走。\n# Instruction:\n当我输入 [动物] + [场景] + [拯救方式] 时，请为我生成一段 4K 超写实、POV 纪录片风格的 AI 视频提示词。\n# Prompt Framework (必须包含以下要素):\n1. Environment: [动物] 被厚实、半透明、带有裂纹的冰块完美包裹，固定在 [场景] 上。\n2. POV Action: 第一人称视角，一只戴防寒手套的手出现在画面，使用 [拯救方式] 介入。\n3. Physics: 模拟真实物理反馈。若是敲击则呈现网格状碎裂(Shattering)；若是浇水则产生浓郁水蒸气(Steam)和相变。\n4. Recovery: 冰脱落瞬间，动物必须展现眨眼、呼吸或抖动羽毛的动作，随后立刻展翅高飞。\n5. Quality: 8k resolution, cinematic lighting, hyper-realistic, 60fps, fluid dynamics.\n# Output Format:\n- 中文描述 (用于理解)\n- English Prompt (直接复制到 Sora/Luma/Kling 使用)\n使用方法（直接输入关键词）\n- 你的输入： 猫头鹰 + 木桩 + 榔头敲击\n- AI 的输出： > English Prompt: POV cinematographic video. A majestic owl is completely encased in a thick, transparent ice shell on a wooden post. A hand in a black glove enters the frame with a steel hammer, gently tapping the ice. Realistic shattering physics follow: the ice cracks into intricate patterns and falls away. The owl immediately shakes its feathers and takes flight. 8k, ultra-realistic.\n- 你的输入： 企鹅 + 冰原 + 浇热水\n- AI 的输出： > English Prompt: POV close-up. A penguin is frozen to the icy ground. A hand pours steaming hot water from a thermos. Dense white steam erupts instantly, and the ice shell rapidly melts and slides off. The penguin shakes its body and waddles away. Realistic fluid and steam simulation, 4k, hyper-realistic.",
				"Hello",
